    "innovation": "This paper presents a systematic global comparison of extreme precipitation trends between observations (HadEX2) and CMIP5 models, carefully subsampling model data to match observational coverage and finding that models significantly underestimate the observed increasing trend.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
